@startuml
!include _style.iuml
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam maxMessageSize 320
skinparam ArrowFontSize 15
skinparam LegendFontSize 14

title Sequence view · HLS segments redirect from Media to private S3\nAs built at 76282d3
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/media/api/v1_hls.py#L25
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/media/services/storage.py#L191

skinparam ArrowFontSize 17
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam NoteFontSize 17
skinparam LegendFontSize 17
actor "owner player" as C $CLIENT
participant "v1_hls\n«Media module»" as H $MEDIA
participant "s: AsyncSession" as DB $INFRA
participant "storage: Storage" as S $MEDIA
collections "output: S3" as B $INFRA
C -> H : GET /jobs/{job_id}/hls/master.m3u8
activate H
H -> DB : SQL: lock owned Asset; read projection
note over H,DB : safe_hls_path; submitted Asset; done projection; hls_manifest required, else 404.
H -> S : read_playlist(key)
activate S
S -> B : GET object [internal.get_object(output_bucket,key)]
B --> S : response stream
S --> H : playlist bytes (bounded to 1 MiB)
deactivate S
H --> C : HTTP 200 playlist; private, no-store
deactivate H
C -> H : GET /jobs/{job_id}/hls/v0/seg00000.ts
activate H
H -> S : sign_output(key,inline=True)
activate S
S --> H : signed segment URL: str
deactivate S
H --> C : RedirectResponse(url,status_code=307)
deactivate H
C -> B : GET redirected URL (optional Range)
B --> C : HTTP 200 / 206 segment bytes
legend bottom
Both requests repeat owner + ready-output checks. Filled = awaited request; dashed = reply.
endlegend

@enduml
